    "sections": {
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress plugin repository and install the plugin.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Note: This plugin works with Elementor. Make sure you have <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementor/\" rel=\"ugc\">Elementor</a> installed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>PHP version 7.0 or greater.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/elementor/\" rel=\"ugc\">Elementor</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>This plugin adds additional icons to Elementor. You can use the icons for free.</p>\n<h3>Thanks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://https://github.com/uiwjs/bootstrap-icons\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bootstrap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mobirise.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Mobirise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://simplelineicons.github.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SimpleLine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mobiriseicons.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Mobirise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PrestaShop/prestashop-icon-font\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Prestashop</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://linearicons.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Linearicons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://themify.me/themify-icons\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Themify</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<p>Feel free to express your opinions, suggestions, and criticisms.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:&#097;&#x6d;&#105;r&#x68;&#111;&#x73;&#x73;&#101;&#x69;&#110;&#046;&#x6d;&#046;k&#x69;&#097;&#x65;&#x69;&#064;&#x67;&#x6d;&#097;&#x69;&#108;&#046;&#x63;&#111;m\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Mail</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Mansourkia\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Github</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
